  "sourceConcerns": [
    "The English source equates a locale with a country code under ISO 3166, although a country code alone does not specify a locale. Preserve the source claim pending author correction.",
    "The English source calls `Intl` a class; `Intl` is a namespace object, while `Intl.NumberFormat` is a constructor. This is an inherited technical error.",
